  "question": {
    "text": "<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> satisfies the condition <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&nbsp;≥</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mn>3</mn></math>. Then the least value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> is",
